sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / CodeFlare SDK
    participant KAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WH as kuberay-webhook-service<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS
    participant Op as kuberay-operator
    participant CM as cert-manager
    participant GW as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Head as Ray head-svc<br/>8265 HTTP / 6379 gRPC
    participant Worker as Ray Worker Pods
    participant Sub as Submitter Job Pod
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over User,Worker: Flow 1: RayCluster creation on OpenShift (secure defaults)
    User->>KAPI: Create RayCluster<br/>HTTPS 6443, TLS 1.2+, User Bearer token
    KAPI->>WH: Mutate/validate RayCluster<br/>HTTPS 443→9443, cert-manager TLS
    WH-->>KAPI: Patch: secure-trusted-network, tlsOptions.enabled,<br/>networkPolicy, enableIngress=false
    Op->>KAPI: Watch RayCluster<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Op->>KAPI: Create Issuers / CA / head+worker Certificates<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    KAPI-->>CM: Certificate CRs
    CM-->>KAPI: TLS Secrets (CA RSA-4096, leaf 90d)
    Op->>KAPI: Create Pods, Services, NetworkPolicies,<br/>ConfigMap, SA, RoleBinding (HTTPS 6443)
    Op->>KAPI: Create HTTPRoute (platform ns) +<br/>ReferenceGrant (user ns) (HTTPS 6443)
    Worker->>Head: Join GCS<br/>gRPC 6379, mTLS (per-cluster CA)

    Note over User,Head: Flow 2: Dashboard access via Gateway
    User->>GW: GET /ray/{ns}/{cluster}/<br/>HTTPS 443, Platform Gateway auth (outside repo)
    GW->>Head: Rewrite to / → dashboard<br/>HTTP 8265, plaintext, no Ray-layer auth
    Note right of GW: kube-rbac-proxy (8443) SAR is NOT on this path
    Head-->>GW: Dashboard response
    GW-->>User: HTTPS response

    Note over Op,Sub: Flow 3: RayJob submission (K8sJobMode)
    Op->>KAPI: Create RayCluster + batch/v1 Job<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Sub->>Head: ray job submit<br/>HTTP 8265, plaintext, Ray token if enabled
    Op->>Head: Job status polling<br/>HTTP 8265, x-ray-authorization Bearer (optional)
    Head-->>Op: Job status

    Note over Prom,Head: Flow 4: Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS 8443, service-ca TLS, Bearer (TokenReview/SAR)
    Op-->>Prom: Operator metrics
    Prom->>Head: GET metrics<br/>HTTP 8080, plaintext, no auth (MONITORING_NAMESPACE)
    Head-->>Prom: Ray metrics
